    "Real transition /embed/warm loaded 9 of the final embed's 10 JavaScript chunks. Those 9 were reused from browser cache (transferSize 0); the uncached route chunk was only 1,556 compressed bytes.",
    "The casino hashed stylesheet took 932–1552 ms to first byte through the gateway in these samples. The SSR wallet HTML and Atrio scripts were present while rendering/hydration completion still waited.",
